[en.CHARACTER_COMPOSED_NAME]
Composed

[en.CHARACTER_COMPOSED_DESC]
With a name representing serenity and calmness, she is the most unpredictable in terms of temperament. Her dispute with Blossom Burst led to the occurrence of the “Silence”, for which she felt extremely regretful. After the “Silence” ended, she starred in the musical “The Phantom of the Opera” written by Autumn Blaze, gaining popularity. Later, due to her architectural talent, she served as the director of the Kirin Commune Construction Bureau. She appears rational, but is also very stubborn, persisting in the pursuit of what she believes in.

[zh.CHARACTER_COMPOSED_NAME]
安详

[zh.CHARACTER_COMPOSED_DESC]
名字代表着镇定、冷静，但她的脾气确实最捉摸不透的。她与繁花的争执导致了“静默”的发生，为此她感到极为后悔。“静默”结束后，她出演了秋烨编剧的音乐剧《歌剧魅影》，因而受到欢迎。后由于其建筑天赋，担任麒麟社群建设局局长。看上去比较理性，但也非常偏执，对于认定的追求会一直坚持到底。
